# Graph / Dependências

## Módulo → Dependências

### src/server/storage.ts
  - `@/data/types` (Task, Module, etc.)
  - `@/lib/records` (AuditEntry, CommentRecord, etc.)
  - `@/lib/rbac` (Role, RoleFunction)
  - `node:sqlite` (DatabaseSync)
  - `node:fs` / `node:path` (SqliteStorage.open)

### src/server/auth.ts
  - `@tanstack/react-start/server` (getCookie, setCookie, deleteCookie, getRequestHeader)
  - `@/lib/rbac` (PublicUser, userCan, Permission)
  - `./storage` (Storage, UserRow)

### src/server/n8n.ts
  - Nenhuma dependência interna (apenas `fetch` global, `process.env`)

### src/server/postgres-storage.ts
  - `./storage` (SqliteBackend, SCHEMA, StorageInfo)
  - `pg` (Pool) / `@neondatabase/serverless` (neon)

### src/lib/portal-api.ts
  - `@tanstack/react-start` (createServerFn)
  - `zod` (z)
  - `@/lib/rbac` (userCan, roleLabel, defaultRoleForNewUser, movePermission)
  - `@/lib/portal-utils` (addMonthsBR, fmtBR)
  - `@/lib/doc-schemas` (docKinds, docKindLabel, docSchemas)
  - `@/lib/records` (AuditEntry, JsonObject, PortalStatePayload, PublicInvite)
  - `@/data/types` (Priority)
  - `@/server/login-logger` (logLoginAttempt)
  - `@/server/context` (serverCtx, requestKey, isRateLimited, registerFailure, clearFailures, logAudit, newId)
  - `@/server/auth` (publicUser, publicUserWithFunctions, AuthError)
  - `@/server/storage` (getStorage, isStoragePersistent, getStorageInitError)

### src/server/login-logger.ts
  - `node:fs` (appendFileSync, mkdirSync, existsSync)
  - `node:path` (join)

### src/server/passwords-helpers.ts
  - `./storage` (Storage)
  - `./passwords` (não lido diretamente; assume hashPassword, verifyPassword, generateSaltHex)

### src/lib/rbac.ts
  - Nenhuma dependência interna (apenas tipos)

### src/routes/*.tsx
  - `@tanstack/react-router` (createFileRoute, Link, useNavigate)
  - `@tanstack/react-query` (useQueryClient)
  - `sonner` (toast)
  - Componentes internos (`@/components/ui/*`)
  - Hooks internos (`@/lib/api-hooks`)
